ooking, and building, and contribute creatively </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >by sculpting, drawing, and filming. Every task can be automated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their artistic creations become lasting parts of the ecosystem you build together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/f686ec99a14a5e7f536886f40de23f03.avif?t=1773818485\" width=616 height=70 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/0076f787bbf1d6d3ecb578c1abb5b7e7.poster.avif?t=1773818485\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/0076f787bbf1d6d3ecb578c1abb5b7e7.webm?t=1773818485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/0076f787bbf1d6d3ecb578c1abb5b7e7.mp4?t=1773818485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own house, place furniture, and decorate a cozy home for you and your pets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Housing is a strategy, a core memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/637c5be32c9a3508ebc1223ed397aa2a.avif?t=1773818485\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/90e9f035c3ac3c67ed641261e32dd7c0.poster.avif?t=1773818485\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/90e9f035c3ac3c67ed641261e32dd7c0.webm?t=1773818485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/90e9f035c3ac3c67ed641261e32dd7c0.mp4?t=1773818485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 kinds of pets are here, but that\u2019s just the beginning. Players can create entirely new pets </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >through the breeding system. Your name will be featured in the new pet\u2019s illustrated guide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/87c644e1ff2f4e91c755019980802968.avif?t=1773818485\" width=616 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/02bb736922a25746df1f3551aa41bc88.poster.avif?t=1773818485\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/02bb736922a25746df1f3551aa41bc88.webm?t=1773818485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/02bb736922a25746df1f3551aa41bc88.mp4?t=1773818485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layerland reflects the exact terrain of Earth through Cesium technology! Mountains, oceans, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and grassfields from the real world you\u2019ve only imagined exploring will become your playground in Layerland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/e367bb11e04e45339ce7a33914de1382.avif?t=1773818485\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/d194683e569e993ed686e431834da22c.poster.avif?t=1773818485\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/d194683e569e993ed686e431834da22c.webm?t=1773818485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/d194683e569e993ed686e431834da22c.mp4?t=1773818485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a true-to-scale Earth built from real satellite data! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dimensional rifts open gates that transport players to alternate worlds\u2014each with a completely different ecosystem, yet mapped to the same coordinates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/7470ebd8132c87818b866f6987786c9c.avif?t=1773818485\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/38b3bba68facc2110de99aab85de41a2.poster.avif?t=1773818485\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/38b3bba68facc2110de99aab85de41a2.webm?t=1773818485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/extras/38b3bba68facc2110de99aab85de41a2.mp4?t=1773818485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invasion Gates can appear anywhere, anytime\u2014without warning! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether the monsters pouring through are a deadly threat or a rare opportunity </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for valuable loot depends entirely on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base with fortifications built alongside your loyal pet, and claim precious rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > for your bravery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["PUDDING Co. Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884970/10abc4e897d67b72a9cd6a59c181f6fcbec95b1c/header.jpg?t=1773818485","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884970/543613080/5189274b63711be6827c2aee0c13dafe6e14b9af/1770876361/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770877905","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884970/543613080/5189274b63711be6827c2aee0c13dafe6e14b9af/1770876361/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770877905","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884970/543613080/5189274b63711be6827c2aee0c13dafe6e14b9af/1770876361/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770877905","id":257194843,"name":"trailorEngVers","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257194843/33e0643d4abb90b9adc3cfd8681171e4589250af/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1770877905"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3884970/83885247/f579d930c89d68c290877083698758e342fc637d/1767759776/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767760739","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/38849